author=enawba
description=Adds ColorOS Messages (com.android.mms 17.62.60 from ColorOS 17 India) as a system app on ColorOS 17 firmware that lacks it, e.g. OnePlus Open EU/global. Needs COS17 Comms Enabler v1.6+.
